# GRUB SHIFT: contracts 1-3 give ten shifts, 4-6 nine, then eight. The quota
# is always 30. The field has 4 planters on contract 1 and up to 8 later,
# one or two sinkholes, and from contract 10 some grubs start grown.
game grubshift
wait 5
cheat contract 1 11
expect days == 10
expect quota == 30
expect planters >= 4
expect holes >= 1
expect holes <= 2
expect adults == 0
cheat contract 3 12
expect days == 10
cheat contract 4 13
expect days == 9
cheat contract 6 14
expect days == 9
cheat contract 7 15
expect days == 8
expect adults == 0
cheat contract 10 16
expect adults == 1
cheat contract 13 17
expect adults == 2
cheat contract 17 18
expect adults == 2
expect days == 8
